        "661": {"synopsis":"Row ($D73C) goes to the rows below the window (BELOW_PUSH; when there is no room there,\nnothing is done), rows B to ($D73C) - 1 move down by one, the screen scrolled the same way\n($10B6), and the row at HL copied into row B.\nEntry: B = the row, HL = the new row.\nExit: carry when done. Keeps BC."},
        "662": {"comment":"The new row kept"},
