        "742": {"synopsis":"Takes the character in column B out of the row at DE, moving columns B+1 to the last one to\nthe left; character A comes in at the last column.\nExit: A = E = the character taken out, Z when it was 0; HL = the row's flags byte. Keeps DE."},
        "743": {"comment":"HL = the width"},
