        "2070": {"comment":"Back to just after its text"},
        "2073": {"synopsis":"HL and DE restored."},
        "2076": {"synopsis":"Before the cursor leaves row C downwards: when the line was edited ($D5B7 bit 3) and row C\nis its last row (flags bit 3), the line is entered (EDIT_LINE_ENTER).\nExit: carry to go on (no carry: a report).","comment":"A = $D5B7"},
        "2079": {"comment":"The line changed?"},
        "2081": {"comment":"No: on, with carry"},
        "2083": {"comment":"DE = row C"},
        "2086": {"comment":"HL = the width"},
        "2089": {"comment":"HL = the flags byte"},
        "2090": {"comment":"The line's last row?"},
        "2092": {"comment":"No: on, with carry"},
        "2094": {"comment":"Yes: the line entered"},
        "2096": {"synopsis":"As LEAVE_LAST_ROW, upwards: when the line was edited ($D5B7 bit 3) and row C is its first\nrow (flags bit 0), the line is entered.","comment":"A = $D5B7"},
        "2099": {"comment":"The line changed?"},
        "2101": {"comment":"No: on, with carry"},
        "2103": {"comment":"DE = row C"},
        "2106": {"comment":"HL = the width"},
        "2109": {"comment":"HL = the flags byte"},
        "2110": {"comment":"The line's first row?"},
        "2112": {"comment":"No: on, with carry"},
        "2114": {"synopsis":"Enters the edited line the cursor is on (also from $221D, with C = 0):\n1. The line's first row found (LINE_FIRST_ROW): the reader's state 2 (window rows) from\n   there;\nabove row 0, state 1 (the rows above the window) from row 0.\n2. The reader's state (bit 7 set), column 0 and row stored at $D5AF and kept at $D5B2; $D5B5\n= 0.\n3. In bank 0, $5B6C = ROM 1's $0BCF and ERR_SP pointing at $5B3A; then $15AC in bank 7.\n4. With the word at $D7F7 above $0500 the line is not entered: ENTER_DIFF.\n5. Otherwise it is entered (ROM 1's LINE_ENTER, $09EC, IX kept, interrupts on). No report:\n$D5B7 bit 3 cleared, the key mode reset (ROM 0's KEY_MODE_RESET), the rows rebuilt, a\nhigh beep (ROM 0's BEEP_HIGH), the cursor's place in C, B, A, carry.\n6. A report (ERR_NR not $FF): the reader set back (ENTER_FAILED), $15A8, and the cursor\nmoved by the difference between ($D5B5) and BC (ENTER_DIFF).\nExit: carry when entered.","comment":"The line's first row found"},
        "2117": {"synopsis":"The reader's state, column 0 and row, twice.","comment":"HL = the reader's state"},
        "2120": {"comment":"DE = its copy"},
        "2123": {"comment":"Bit 7: count the places"},
        "2125": {"comment":"The state stored twice"},
        "2127": {"comment":"Column 0"},
        "2134": {"comment":"Row C"},
        "2137": {"comment":"No places counted yet"},
        "2143": {"comment":"Bank 0 and the normal stack"},
        "2144": {"comment":"The handler at $5B6C = $0BCF"},
        "2150": {"comment":"ERR_SP to point at $5B3A"},
        "2154": {"comment":"ERR_SP set"},
        "2158": {"comment":"Bank 7 and the alternate stack"},
        "2159": {"comment":"$15AC"},
        "2162": {"comment":"Bank 0 and the normal stack"},
        "2163": {"comment":"$5B3A dropped"},
        "2164": {"comment":"Bank 7 and the alternate stack"},
        "2165": {"comment":"BC = the word at $D7F7"},
        "2169": {"comment":"Not above $0500?"},
        "2175": {"comment":"Above: not entered, the cursor moved instead"},
        "2179": {"comment":"Bank 0 and the normal stack"},
        "2180": {"comment":"The line entered (LINE_ENTER)"},
        "2183": {"comment":"Bank 7 and the alternate stack"},
        "2184": {"comment":"Interrupts on"},
        "2187": {"comment":"A = ERR_NR"},
        "2190": {"comment":"$FF: no report?"},
        "2191": {"comment":"A report"},
        "2193": {"comment":"HL = $D5B7"},
        "2196": {"comment":"The line not changed any more"},
        "2198": {"comment":"The key mode reset (KEY_MODE_RESET)"},
        "2201": {"comment":"The rows rebuilt and drawn"},
        "2204": {"comment":"A high beep (BEEP_HIGH)"},
        "2207": {"comment":"C, B, A = the cursor's place"},
        "2210": {"comment":"Carry: entered"},
        "2212": {"synopsis":"A report while the line was entered: the reader's state set back ($D5B2-$D5B4 to\n$D5AF-$D5B1, bit 7 cleared), then $15A8.","comment":"HL = the reader's state"},
