        "2746": {"synopsis":"Inserts a blank row at row C flagged $29 (the line's first and last row, and bit 5)\n(INSERT_ROW); DE = row C.","comment":"DE = row C"},
        "2749": {"comment":"Flags $29"},
        "2751": {"synopsis":"Inserts a blank row at window row C (ROWS_DOWN_FROM, the rows from C down moving down) and\ngives it flags A. The blank row is built at $E090: ($D73D) 0s, flags $29, line number 0.\nExit: carry when done. Keeps BC, DE."},
