        "2982": {"comment":"Stored"},
        "2983": {"comment":"HL = the row, DE = the flags byte"},
        "2985": {"synopsis":"Removes window row C (at DE), which holds no text:\n1. When it is not its line's first row (flags bit 0), the row above (C - 1, or the last row\n   above the window for row 0, $D752 stepped by $1482) gets bit 1 cleared and row C's flags\n   added.\n2. The rows below move up into its place (ROWS_UP_FROM with the next row from below).\nExit: carry when done.","comment":"HL = the width"},
        "2988": {"comment":"HL = the flags byte"},
        "2989": {"comment":"A = the flags"},
