        "3239": {"comment":"Deleted"},
        "3243": {"comment":"Again"},
        "3245": {"synopsis":"The start of a deleting key: $D5B7 bit 0 cleared, the cursor loaded and taken off the screen\n(CURSOR_OFF), $D741 bit 2 set (no drawing while rows move).\nExit: HL = $D748; C, B, A as CURSOR_GET.","comment":"HL = $D5B7"},
        "3248": {"comment":"The rows not full any more"},
