        "4144": {"synopsis":"Stops with error code $0A, report B (NextZXOS ROM 1's ERROR_128_A). Reached from all over\nthe page.","comment":"Error code $0A: report B (NextZXOS ROM 1's ERROR_128_A)"},
        "4149": {"synopsis":"RAM bank 0 and the normal stack back ($00E8), then ERR_B. Also reached from $06F3.","comment":"RAM bank 0 and the normal stack back first"},
        "4152": {"comment":"Then report B"},
        "4154": {"synopsis":"TILE DIM bank, offset, width, size (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for TILE DIM, the\nword at its $0506): the tile map of the current mode:\n1. The tile size 8 or 16 (report B otherwise) into $5BBE.\n2. The map width 1-2048 in tiles (report B otherwise), the map's offset and bank checked by\n   NextZXOS ROM 1's BANK_PAGE_ROM3 (an offset of $4000 or more is report B).\n3. Layer 2: width $5B7E, bank $5B76, offset $5B82, 16 x 16 tiles in $5C7F bit 7. LoRes\n   (TILE_DIM_LORES): $5B7C, $5B74, $5B80 and $5C7F bit 6.","comment":"Checking: done; running: A = the mode (1 LoRes)"},
        "4157": {"comment":"Kept"},
