        "4253": {"synopsis":"LAYER OVER n (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for LAYER OVER, the word at its $051C): the\nlayer order, 0-7 (report B otherwise), into bits 4-2 of NextReg $15 (through $05C5 and\nNextZXOS ROM 1's NEXTREG_15_MASK; the other bits kept).","comment":"A = the order (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_BYTE)"},
