        "4267": {"synopsis":"LAYER AT x, y (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for LAYER AT, the word at its $0524): the\nscroll offsets of the current mode, x 0-255, y 0-191 (report B otherwise): NextRegs $32/$33\nfor LoRes, $16/$17 for Layer 2.","comment":"Checking: done; running: a mode that has tiles"},
