        "4297": {"synopsis":"LAYER BANK n, m (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for LAYER BANK, the word at its $0520):\nLayer 2's RAM banks: n into NextReg $12 (the bank shown), m into NextReg $13 (the shadow\nbank). Each must be 9 or more (report B otherwise) and it and the two banks after it are\nchecked through NextZXOS ROM 1's BANK_PAGE_ROM3 ($330B).","comment":"A = the second bank (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_BYTE)"},
        "4300": {"comment":"Kept"},
