        "4386": {"synopsis":"LAYER ERASE x, y, w, h [, c] (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for LAYER ERASE, the word\nat its $052A; the optional colour is read here): fills a w x h block of the current mode's\nscreen at x, y with colour c, or with the global transparent colour (NextReg $14) without\none. w 1-256 (report B otherwise); $3616 checks the block fits (report B) and pages the\nscreen in; $3689 gives each next row; on the other stack ($5B6A).","comment":"A colour after a ','?"},
